        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>LCN Concealed Overhead Door Closers</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Concealed LCN 2014 is designed to mount in the door frame. \r\nThis heavy duty door closer is designed to provide complete concealment.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe single lever arm and roller assembly provide smooth, quiet door control. This is a handed closer with a spring size 4 and Aluminum finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-5000-size.gif?v=1704354507\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"LCN 2014 closer dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe LCN 2014 designed for  Exterior Doors 30\" - 36\" and Interior Doors 38\" - 48\"\r\n</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/2010.pdf?v=1704262219\" target=\"new\"><b>LCN 2014 Installation Diagram (PDF).</b></a>\r\n</P>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Handed door closer is UL and ULC listed for self-closing doors without hold-open and comes with a 15 year warranty.\r\nTested and certified under ANSI Standard A156.4, <b>Grade 1</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with door closer, mounting bracket, closer arm, track, roller and installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this door closer:  \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>",
